    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Represents the number of shares of Common Stock that have been withheld by the issuer to satisfy its income tax withholding and remittance obligations in connection with the net settlement of the Restricted Stock Units (&quot;RSUs&quot;) and does not represent a sale.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Each restricted stock unit (&quot;RSU&quot;) represents a contingent right to receive one share of Issuer common stock.</footnote>
